OL,3,ADR Congo sentences 66 soldiers to death
OL,4,Afor being 'cowards'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe region has endured decades of
OL,7,Fconflict, with fighting continuing
OL,8,Fbetween government forces and the Front
OL,9,Ffor the Refoundation of the Nation
OL,10,F(FRN), a rebel coalition that includes
OL,11,Fthe M23 group.
